      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "row-procedure",
      "description": "Divided full-width record row with a serif title and compact metadata.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-procedure\"><span class=\"ds-row-top\"><span>Gilbués</span><span>2025 · Registro de preços</span></span><strong>Registro de preços para aquisição futura e parcelada de medicamentos</strong><span class=\"ds-row-bottom\"><span>4 itens padronizados · 27/01/2025</span><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-procedure{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#dcd3d5);padding:19px 0;background:none;color:var(--ink,#0d0d0d);cursor:pointer}.ds-procedure:hover{background:#fcf8f9}.ds-procedure:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--wine,#73030d);outline-offset:4px}.ds-row-top,.ds-row-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:7px;font:9px/1.5 var(--ui,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif);color:var(--muted,#675c5f)}.ds-row-top>span:first-child{color:var(--wine-soft,#732f3b);font-weight:700}.ds-procedure>strong{display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:3;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;font:700 18px/1.25 var(--serif,\"Tinos\",\"Times New Roman\",serif);margin:10px 0 12px}.ds-row-bottom svg{color:var(--wine,#73030d)}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-procedure>strong{font-size:20px}.ds-row-top,.ds-row-bottom{font-size:10px}}"
